root/public/cursor-mock/

# Python bytecode from the asset scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── ASSET MASTERS NEVER GO UP ──────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Two gigabytes of bakes behind thirty-one megabytes of game. A master is a
# 20-70 MB file that gets retopologised, re-baked, blanked, quantised and
# meshopt-compressed down to a few hundred kilobytes, and only the last of
# those belongs in a repo.
#
# `3D ASSETS` and `meshy_output` live one level ABOVE this repository and
# git cannot reach them from here — these two lines are insurance for the
# day somebody moves them in, which costs nothing and would otherwise be
# found out by a push. See AK-3D-PACK.md for what came from where.
AK 3D Pack/
3D ASSETS/
meshy_output/
